<title>USA: North Hempstead, N.Y., won by Merrill at 5.32 pct.</title>
<headline>North Hempstead, N.Y., won by Merrill at 5.32 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc said Wednesday it won $37.7 million North Hempstead, N.Y., unlimited tax bonds at a true interest cost of 5.32 percent.</p>
</text>
